.TH EDIFF 1.SH NAMEediff \- put diff's output into plain English.SH SYNOPSIS\fBdiff f1 f2 ! ediff\fR.br\fBediff < difffile\fR.SH DESCRIPTION\fBediff\fRreads the output of\fBdiff\fRand writes it out again in words:.nf    -------- 1 line changed at 3    from: old text    to:   new text.fiIt compares nothing itself; it makes diff's answer readable..SH SEE ALSOdiff, tcmp